{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-30","kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得引理：素数整除乘积必整除一个因子","englishTitle":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make some number, and any prime number measure the product, it will also measure one of the original numbers.","book":7,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","contentId":"euclid-7-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a0e68cee9e3c36bcbf398e9e2066df46dc0656c144ba4b1b16941f9f17576a8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-30.statement","euclid-7-30.construction.1","euclid-7-30.construction.2","euclid-7-30.proof.1","euclid-7-30.proof.2","euclid-7-30.proof.3","euclid-7-30.proof.4","euclid-7-30.proof.5","euclid-7-30.proof.6","euclid-7-30.proof.7","euclid-7-30.conclusion","euclid-7-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed145a41c9b501b658b799c6bccd54d1f145fc82931a1baac211baf1f8434718","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make some number, and any prime number measure the product, it will also measure one of the original numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字通过相互乘法 得出了一定的数字, 任何素数 整除 的产品, 它也会是整除 一个原始数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6eb501325fe4bacac684d51da1149dbce990770bbc0d131a3e11157ba956c705","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B by multiplying one another make C, and let any prime number D measure C; I say that D measures one of the numbers A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"数字A,B,乘以乘以C, 数字素数,D,整除,C,我说数字A,B,B"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d9e16dd738c6bb9a800f15631c8549a0c30016ea2cb9b356ac03937327b35d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let it not measure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"千万别让整除 -A"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7d6e2f454f61b16337d81531a78a122448d7ef2e0b28c53efd258239ed2164f","citations":["euclid-7-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now D is prime; therefore A, D are prime to one another. [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在D是黄金,A,D是互素。 [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98cda005466c1f1d315029bc825b50455123f0957d223bea1ab2287249be2d5a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as D measures C, so many units let there be in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有 D 整除 C乘以多少倍这么多单位让E有。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6953d9df78e17748624370c0fe0ccd396ea7258ddf34676ec6dd9c22fced3f96","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then D measures C according to the units in E, therefore D by multiplying E has made C. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,根据E的单位数据,D 整除 C,因此,D乘以E, 使C。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6085b5f381821b05aff404238f1d5ba782e6c0d7155c943b1507be63ef3be43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Further, A by multiplying B has also made C; therefore the product of D, E is equal to the product of A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此外,A乘以B,也达到C;因此D,E的产值等于A,B的产值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a4e54ca113ed90e9678ec1e90fdc1e3fa79e8d709552efd8cb09fa053d94672","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as D is to A, so is B to E. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,D比A等于B比E；D 与 A 之比等于 B 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b548584825c57eb39262f1ebeae5662e7d2202438ddd83af0f762f8ada599e79","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D, A are prime to one another, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least measure the numbers which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore D measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,A是互素, 质数也是最少的, 而同样比例的最少整除, 数量相同,数量较大,数量较小,数量较小,数量较小,即,前身的前身和随后的后遗症; 因此, D, 整除, B。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb1e1fed91b67c5890eb1825d751248ab5e664205fd511a63e26bbce076d343c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can also show that, if D do not measure B, it will measure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们也可以证明,如果D不整除 B,它就会整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74627a2f7a76aa6e05c6f22a9704eace8a486888de47ee5577394f19e64600d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D measures one of the numbers A, B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,D 整除中就有A、B、E、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-30.source","contentId":"euclid-7-30","revisionId":"euclid-7-30@raw-1a0e68cee9e3c36b","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a0f98689980d56150dc57759b93903d2c7795565c7b84d0d5b52dfe2c3107bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-30:euclid-7-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-30.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"VII. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-30:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-30.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"ur